  "description": "ST VL53L4CD time-of-flight high accuracy proximity sensor, bare module in Optical LGA12 4.4 x 2.4 x 1 mm (order code with protective liner): 940 nm Class 1 VCSEL and SPAD collector, 0-1200 mm with full FoV (1300 mm typical at 50 % detection, white target), linear from 1 mm, 18 deg diagonal FoV, up to 100 Hz, on-chip processing. Single 2.6-3.5 V supply (2.8 V nominal), 22 mA typical while ranging, 5 uA hardware standby; I2C target at 0x29 up to 1 MHz; open-drain interrupt (GPIO1) and active-low XSHUT.",
  "domains": [
